    "main": "The global object is not one hidden group. It is a finite union of value-linear certificates: six C32 slope cells, one C8 row-parallelogram cell, and eleven nullity-one isolated complement-pair cells.",
    "why_R22_is_sporadic": "For every R22 preferred certificate, rank([W;1])=8, so the centered value solution space is one-dimensional; its intersection with the permutation value shell is exactly two points, gamma and value-complement gamma.",
